    in your GY; shuffle it into the Deck. While this card has "Madolche Puddingcess"
    as material, when a "Madolche" card(s) in your GY is shuffled into the Main Deck
    (except during the Damage Step): You can detach 1 material from this card; Special
    Summon 1 "Madolche" monster from your Deck in Attack Position or face-down Defense
    Position.'
